<!-- 01 - Linear programming: XML, a data-oriented linear language.
     There is no branching and no loop here — every line is read top to
     bottom, once, in the order it's written. That's what "linear" means. -->
<note>
   <to>John</to>
   <from>Marica</from>
   <heading category="reminder">Team Meeting</heading>
   <body>Please review the roadmap before Friday's stand-up.</body>
</note>
